{"id":"nuevamente","lemma":"nuevamente","pos":"adv","rank":1777,"glosses":["newly","again"],"ipa":"/ˌnwebaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-nuevamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Por favor, inténtelo nuevamente.","en":"Please try again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/425021"},{"text":"Soy yo nuevamente, Tom.","en":"It's me again, Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799324"},{"text":"No me dejes nuevamente.","en":"Don't leave me again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455123"},{"text":"Me gustaría ser joven nuevamente.","en":"I'd like to be young again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519099"},{"text":"¿Queréis que os lo explique nuevamente?","en":"Do you want me to explain it again?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/427613"}]}